==========================================================

Donor Trust Quota Application

Environment Configuration Template

==========================================================

Copy to .env for local development.

Never commit .env or production secrets to GitHub.

This is an independent proposal application, not an official

WBMCC submission service.

Privacy principles:

- No third-party analytics or advertising by default.

- Do not log application payloads, identity documents or tokens.

- Store uploaded documents in private storage.

- Do not place secrets, personal data or session IDs in URLs.

- Minimize collection, access and retention of personal data.

IMPORTANT:

This file contains configuration examples, not credentials.

A setting has no effect unless application code implements it.

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

1. Application

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

NODE_ENV=development
APP_NAME=Donor Trust Quota Application
APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
PORT=3000
HOST=0.0.0.0

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

2. PostgreSQL database

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

Supply your real provider connection string privately.

DATABASE_URL=

Used by the current server.js implementation.

Enable verified TLS when required by your database provider.

PGSSL=false

Additional pool settings for future server implementation.

DB_SSL=false
DB_POOL_MIN=0
DB_POOL_MAX=10
DB_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MS=10000

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

3. Authentication and sessions

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

Generate a unique cryptographically random secret locally.

Do not use a placeholder or commit a real secret.

SESSION_SECRET=

SESSION_COOKIE_NAME=donor_quota_session
SESSION_TTL_MS=28800000
SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE=false
SESSION_COOKIE_HTTP_ONLY=true
SESSION_COOKIE_SAME_SITE=lax

Generate a separate administrator API token.

Keep this secret exclusively in server-side configuration.

ADMIN_API_TOKEN=

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

4. Network and API security

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

Current server.js accepts false or a numeric proxy hop count.

Configure the exact trusted proxy topology in production.

TRUST_PROXY=false

Use exact origins, without wildcard access.

Separate multiple trusted origins with commas.

CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=60
AUTH_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=10

JSON_BODY_LIMIT=100kb
REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=30000

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

5. Private file uploads

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

UPLOAD_DIR=private-uploads
MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB=10
MAX_FILES_PER_APPLICATION=15
ALLOWED_UPLOAD_MIME_TYPES=application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png
UPLOADS_PUBLICLY_ACCESSIBLE=false

Storage provider integration must be implemented separately.

FILE_STORAGE_PROVIDER=local
FILE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
FILE_STORAGE_REGION=
FILE_STORAGE_ENDPOINT=
FILE_STORAGE_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
FILE_STORAGE_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=

Never serve private uploads through express.static().

Validate actual file contents, scan files, and authorize downloads.

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

6. PDF generation

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

PDF_OUTPUT_DIR=private-generated
PDF_FILENAME_PREFIX=donor-quota-application
PDF_INCLUDE_SUBMISSION_REFERENCE=true

PDF generation and protected download routes require implementation.

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

7. Application workflow

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

APPLICATION_REFERENCE_PREFIX=DTQ
APPLICATION_DRAFT_TTL_DAYS=30
REQUIRE_CONSENT_BEFORE_SUBMISSION=true

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

8. Privacy-conscious logging

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

LOG_LEVEL=info
LOG_REDACT_SENSITIVE_DATA=true
LOG_REQUEST_BODIES=false
LOG_RESPONSE_BODIES=false

Do not log authorization headers, cookies, uploaded files,

applicant payloads, identity numbers, signatures or credentials.

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

9. Optional email notifications

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

Leave blank until a provider is configured.

EMAIL_PROVIDER=
EMAIL_FROM=
EMAIL_API_KEY=

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

10. Health and readiness

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

HEALTH_CHECK_ENABLED=true

Current server.js provides /health and /ready.

Do not expose database details or secrets in health responses.

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

11. Retention and privacy controls

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

AUDIT_LOG_RETENTION_DAYS=180
UPLOAD_RETENTION_DAYS=365
DELETE_EXPIRED_UPLOADS=false

Retention values are policy proposals, not automatic deletion.

Implement a reviewed retention policy and authorized cleanup job

before enabling automatic deletion.

–––––––––––––––––––––––––––––

End of template

==========================================================